    {
      "id": "z-chain",
      "kind": "content",
      "eyebrow": "光反应核心",
      "headline": "Z 链：电子的瀑布与水的光解",
      "lead": "电子在 P680 与 P700 间的电位跃迁，驱动质子泵并还原 NADP+。",
      "transition": "zoom",
      "notes": "刚才我们看了叶绿体这个反应器，现在深入类囊体膜上的“Z链”——电子被光能两次“踢”上高能态，在传递链中像瀑布般跌落，能量曲线呈Z字形。这里学生常误以为水光解是为了产氧，其实它发生在光系统II（PSII）端，纯粹是为了填补电子空穴；而且要裂解2个水分子释放1个O2，需要精确剥离4个电子，这是个效率极低的艰难过程。当电子在“瀑布”中跌落时释放的能量并未浪费，而是被用来将质子泵入类囊体腔，这就为下一页我们要讲的“化学渗透”与ATP合成埋下了伏笔。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "sim",
          "engine": "widget",
          "html": "<style>\n  .widget {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    height: 100%;\n    padding: 16px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    gap: 12px;\n    background: var(--bg);\n    color: var(--ink);\n  }\n  #stage {\n    flex: 1;\n    width: 100%;\n    min-height: 0;\n    background: var(--card);\n    border-radius: var(--radius);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n  }\n  .controls {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 12px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .toggle-btn {\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    padding: 6px 12px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    background: var(--bg2);\n    color: var(--text2);\n    border-radius: var(--radius);\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 120ms linear;\n    outline: none;\n  }\n  .toggle-btn:hover {\n    border-color: var(--text2);\n  }\n  .toggle-btn:active {\n    transform: scale(0.96);\n  }\n  .toggle-btn.active {\n    border-color: var(--accent);\n    color: var(--accent);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--accent);\n  }\n  .readouts {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 16px;\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: var(--text2);\n    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  }\n  .readout-val {\n    color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .carrier {\n    fill: var(--bg2);\n    stroke: var(--line);\n    stroke-width: 1;\n    transition: stroke 120ms linear, fill 120ms linear;\n  }\n  .carrier.active {\n    stroke: var(--accent);\n    fill: var(--bg2);\n    stroke-width: 2;\n  }\n  .carrier-label {\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-size: 10px;\n    fill: var(--text2);\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .axis-label {\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-size: 9px;\n    fill: var(--line);\n  }\n  .lumen-box {\n    fill: none;\n    stroke: var(--line);\n    stroke-dasharray: 4 4;\n    vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;\n  }\n  .z-path {\n    fill: none;\n    stroke: var(--line);\n    stroke-width: 1;\n    vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;\n  }\n  .tick-line {\n    stroke: var(--line);\n    stroke-width: 1;\n    vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;\n  }\n  .proton-dot {\n    fill: var(--accent);\n    opacity: 0;\n    transition: opacity 200ms linear;\n  }\n  #electron-dot {\n    fill: var(--accent);\n    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px var(--accent));\n  }\n  .flash-circle {\n    fill: var(--accent);\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  #step-readout {\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    fill: var(--text2);\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"widget\">\n  <svg id=\"stage\" viewBox=\"0 0 880 480\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n    <!-- Y Axis Ticks -->\n    <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"840\" y2=\"80\" class=\"tick-line\" opacity=\"0.3\"/>\n    <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"840\" y2=\"180\" class=\"tick-line\" opacity=\"0.3\"/>\n    <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"840\" y2=\"280\" class=\"tick-line\" opacity=\"0.3\"/>\n    <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"380\" x2=\"840\" y2=\"380\" class=\"tick-line\" opacity=\"0.3\"/>\n    \n    <text x=\"20\" y=\"85\" class=\"axis-label\">高电位</text>\n    <text x=\"20\" y=\"405\" class=\"axis-label\">低电位</text>\n\n    <!-- Lumen Box -->\n    <rect x=\"460\" y=\"290\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" rx=\"4\" class=\"lumen-box\"/>\n    <text x=\"500\" y=\"385\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"axis-label\">腔内</text>\n\n    <!-- Proton Dots -->\n    <g id=\"proton-group\">\n      <!-- Generated by JS -->\n    </g>\n\n    <!-- Z Path -->\n    <path d=\"M100,400 L200,400 L200,80 L300,180 L400,260 L500,320 L600,350 L680,370 L680,80 L760,180 L840,400\" class=\"z-path\"/>\n\n    <!-- Carriers -->\n    <circle id=\"carrier-0\" cx=\"100\" cy=\"400\" r=\"8\" class=\"carrier\"/>\n    <circle id=\"carrier-1\" cx=\"200\" cy=\"400\" r=\"8\" class=\"carrier\"/>\n    <circle id=\"carrier-2\" cx=\"200\" cy=\"80\" r=\"8\" class=\"carrier\"/>\n    <circle id=\"carrier-3\" cx=\"300\" cy=\"180\" r=\"8\" class=\"carrier\"/>\n    <circle id=\"carrier-4\" cx=\"400\" cy=\"260\" r=\"8\" class=\"carrier\"/>\n    <circle id=\"carrier-5\" cx=\"500\" cy=\"320\" r=\"8\" class=\"carrier\"/>\n    <circle id=\"carrier-6\" cx=\"600\" cy=\"350\" r=\"8\" class=\"carrier\"/>\n    <circle id=\"carrier-7\" cx=\"680\" cy=\"370\" r=\"8\" class=\"carrier\"/>\n    <circle id=\"carrier-8\" cx=\"680\" cy=\"80\" r=\"8\" class=\"carrier\"/>\n    <circle id=\"carrier-9\" cx=\"760\" cy=\"180\" r=\"8\" class=\"carrier\"/>\n    <circle id=\"carrier-10\" cx=\"840\" cy=\"400\" r=\"8\" class=\"carrier\"/>\n\n    <!-- Labels -->\n    <text x=\"100\" y=\"425\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"carrier-label\">H₂O</text>\n    <text x=\"200\" y=\"425\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"carrier-label\">P680</text>\n    <text x=\"160\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"carrier-label\">P680*</text>\n    <text x=\"300\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"carrier-label\">Pheo</text>\n    <text x=\"400\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"carrier-label\">PQ</text>\n    <text x=\"500\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"carrier-label\">Cyt b6f</text>\n    <text x=\"600\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"carrier-label\">PC</text>\n    <text x=\"680\" y=\"395\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"carrier-label\">P700</text>\n    <text x=\"720\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"carrier-label\">P700*</text>\n    <text x=\"760\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"carrier-label\">Fd</text>\n    <text x=\"840\" y=\"425\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"carrier-label\">NADP⁺</text>\n\n    <!-- Flashes -->\n    <circle id=\"flash680\" cx=\"200\" cy=\"80\" r=\"30\" class=\"flash-circle\" opacity=\"0\"/>\n    <circle id=\"flash700\" cx=\"680\" cy=\"80\" r=\"30\" class=\"flash-circle\" opacity=\"0\"/>\n\n    <!-- Electron -->\n    <circle id=\"electron-dot\" r=\"6\"/>\n\n    <!-- Readout -->\n    <text id=\"step-readout\" x=\"860\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"end\">STEP 06 PC</text>\n  </svg>\n\n  <div class=\"controls\">\n    <button id=\"toggle680\" class=\"toggle-btn active\">PSII 680nm</button>\n    <button id=\"toggle700\" class=\"toggle-btn active\">PSI 700nm</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"readouts\">\n    <span>H₂O 裂解 <span id=\"h2o-count\" class=\"readout-val\">1</span></span>\n    <span>腔内 H⁺ <span id=\"proton-count\" class=\"readout-val\">4</span></span>\n    <span>NADPH <span id=\"nadph-count\" class=\"readout-val\">0</span></span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  const state = {\n    light680: true,\n    light700: true,\n    electronStep: 6,\n    animProgress: 0.3,\n    protonsLumen: 4,\n    nadphCount: 0,\n    h2oSplit: 1,\n    photonFlash680: 0,\n    photonFlash700: 0\n  };\n\n  const coords = [\n    {x:100, y:400}, {x:200, y:400}, {x:200, y:80}, {x:300, y:180},\n    {x:400, y:260}, {x:500, y:320}, {x:600, y:350}, {x:680, y:370},\n    {x:680, y:80}, {x:760, y:180}, {x:840, y:400}\n  ];\n\n  const stepNames = ['H2O', 'P680', 'P680*', 'Pheo', 'PQ', 'Cytb6f', 'PC', 'P700', 'P700*', 'Fd', 'NADP+'];\n\n  // Init proton dots\n  const protonGroup = document.getElementById('proton-group');\n  for(let i=0; i<20; i++) {\n    const c = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'circle');\n    c.setAttribute('id', 'p-dot-' + i);\n    c.setAttribute('class', 'proton-dot');\n    c.setAttribute('r', '3');\n    c.setAttribute('cx', 470 + (i % 5) * 14);\n    c.setAttribute('cy', 300 + Math.floor(i / 5) * 14);\n    protonGroup.appendChild(c);\n  }\n\n  function update(dt) {\n    // Decay flashes\n    state.photonFlash680 *= 0.92;\n    state.photonFlash700 *= 0.92;\n    if (state.photonFlash680 < 0.01) state.photonFlash680 = 0;\n    if (state.photonFlash700 < 0.01) state.photonFlash700 = 0;\n\n    // Advance progress\n    let frozen = false;\n    if (state.electronStep === 1 && !state.light680) frozen = true;\n    if (state.electronStep === 7 && !state.light700) frozen = true;\n\n    if (!frozen) {\n      state.animProgress += dt * 0.4;\n    }\n\n    // Step transition\n    if (state.animProgress >= 1.0) {\n      state.animProgress = 0;\n      state.electronStep = (state.electronStep + 1) % 11;\n\n      if (state.electronStep === 1) state.h2oSplit++;\n      if (state.electronStep === 2) state.photonFlash680 = 1;\n      if (state.electronStep === 5) state.protonsLumen += 4;\n      if (state.electronStep === 8) state.photonFlash700 = 1;\n      if (state.electronStep === 10) state.nadphCount++;\n    }\n\n    // Update Electron Position\n    const from = coords[state.electronStep];\n    const to = coords[(state.electronStep + 1) % 11];\n    const cx = from.x + (to.x - from.x) * state.animProgress;\n    const cy = from.y + (to.y - from.y) * state.animProgress;\n    \n    const dot = document.getElementById('electron-dot');\n    dot.setAttribute('cx', cx);\n    dot.setAttribute('cy', cy);\n\n    // Update Flashes\n    document.getElementById('flash680').style.opacity = state.photonFlash680;\n    document.getElementById('flash700').style.opacity = state.photonFlash700;\n\n    // Update Counts\n    document.getElementById('proton-count').textContent = Math.round(state.protonsLumen);\n    document.getElementById('nadph-count').textContent = Math.round(state.nadphCount);\n    document.getElementById('h2o-count').textContent = Math.round(state.h2oSplit);\n\n    // Highlight Carrier\n    for (let i = 0; i < 11; i++) {\n      const el = document.getElementById('carrier-' + i);\n      el.setAttribute('class', i === state.electronStep ? 'carrier active' : 'carrier');\n    }\n\n    // Update Proton Dots Visibility\n    for (let i = 0; i < 20; i++) {\n      const pDot = document.getElementById('p-dot-' + i);\n      pDot.style.opacity = i < state.protonsLumen ? 0.6 : 0;\n    }\n\n    // Corner Readout\n    document.getElementById('step-readout').textContent = 'STEP ' + String(state.electronStep).padStart(2, '0') + ' ' + stepNames[state.electronStep];\n  }\n\n  // Event Listeners\n  document.getElementById('toggle680').addEventListener('click', () => {\n    state.light680 = !state.light680;\n    document.getElementById('toggle680').classList.toggle('active', state.light680);\n  });\n\n  document.getElementById('toggle700').addEventListener('click', () => {\n    state.light700 = !state.light700;\n    document.getElementById('toggle700').classList.toggle('active', state.light700);\n  });\n\n  // Animation Loop\n  let last = performance.now();\n  (function loop(now) {\n    update(Math.min((now - last) / 1000, 0.05));\n    last = now;\n    requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n  })(performance.now());\n</script>",
          "id": "b_zsim"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "label": "4 光子换 1 O₂",
          "text": "锰簇（放氧复合体）每吸收 1 个光子累积 1 个氧化当量，累积 4 次后从 2 个 $H_2O$ 中强行剥离 4 个 $e^-$，释放 1 个 $O_2$ 与 4 个 $H^+$。",
          "id": "b_water"
        }
      ],
      "layout": {
        "kind": "compose",
        "preset": "sidenote"
